# Study-specific artifacts. Shared Python/LaTeX/venv rules live in the repo-root
# .gitignore.
#
# The caches are the expensive artifact -- they are what `prepare` spends its
# PySCF time on -- but they are reproducible from `molecule.py` and they carry
# their own specification hash, so a stale one is a hard error rather than a
# wrong answer. Keep them out of the history and copy them between machines
# directly; `validate` will refuse any that does not match the current spec.
cache/
results/
